Z||000000||Hybrid2M6||12-10-2001||01:35 PM||||Whoever it was, I've spotted you before. They drove around the back of my work looked at my car going really slow, until they saw me, and then zoomed off after revving the engine once or twice. This person has been seen driving by my car revving before, even when nobody is near the car. Is he trying to race a parked car or something? I don't get it. Any ways it was a Silver GT Fastback rolling thru Bob Townsend Ford's (my work)on Colerain Ave. in Cincinnati Ohio. If this is someone on the forum, I just wanted to say that you could have atleast have said hello or something. If this is anyone you know tell them to catch up with me sometime. I'd like to meet more Fiero owner around here(Ohio). <P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/customgfx.jpg">  <BR>1986 SE IronDuke<BR>Adjustable Touring Wing<BR>American Racing Carrera's<BR> -225/50VR16 Falken Ziex 502<BR> -225/45ZR17 Falken Azenis<BR>Cleared and Painted(red) Tail lights<p>[This message has been edited by Hybrid2M6 (edited 12-10-2001).]||||reg||5
